# Circuit Bazaar — Local Development Guide (Template)

**This file IS committed.** It contains placeholder values so new developers know what to fill in.

For the local-only version with real values (git-ignored), see `DEVELOPMENT.md`.

---

## One-Command Bootstrap

```bash
docker compose up --build
```

After first boot, run migrations:

```bash
docker compose exec backend php artisan migrate --seed
```

Stop (keep database):

```bash
docker compose down
```

Stop and wipe database:

```bash
docker compose down -v
```

---

## Local Port Map

| Service | Port | URL |
|---------|------|-----|
| MySQL | 3306 | `mysql://root:root@localhost:3306` |
| Backend (Laravel) | 8000 | `http://localhost:8000` |
| Customer Frontend | 3000 | `http://localhost:3000` |
| Admin Portal | 3001 | `http://localhost:3001` |
| Vendor Portal | 3002 | `http://localhost:3002` |
| Shop | 3003 | `http://localhost:3003` |

---

## Environment Variables Per Service

### Backend (`backend/.env` — git-ignored)

| Variable | Description | Where to get it |
|----------|-------------|-----------------|
| `APP_NAME` | Application name | Any string |
| `APP_ENV` | Environment mode | `local` / `production` |
| `APP_KEY` | Laravel encryption key | `php artisan key:generate` |
| `APP_DEBUG` | Show debug errors | `true` locally, `false` in production |
| `APP_URL` | Base URL of backend | `http://localhost:8000` locally |
| `DB_CONNECTION` | Database driver | `mysql` |
| `DB_HOST` | MySQL host | `mysql` |
| `DB_PORT` | MySQL port | `3306` |
| `DB_DATABASE` | Database name | `circuit_bazaar` |
| `DB_USERNAME` | Database user | `circuit` |
| `DB_PASSWORD` | Database password | `circuit` |
| `BROADCAST_CONNECTION` | Broadcasting driver | `reverb` |
| `FILESYSTEM_DISK` | Default storage disk | `public` |
| `QUEUE_CONNECTION` | Queue driver | `database` |
| `CACHE_STORE` | Cache driver | `database` |
| `SESSION_DRIVER` | Session driver | `database` |
| `SESSION_LIFETIME` | Session timeout (min) | `120` |
| `MAIL_MAILER` | Mail transport | `log` (dev) / `smtp` (prod) |
| `MAIL_HOST` | SMTP host | e.g. `smtp.gmail.com` |
| `MAIL_PORT` | SMTP port | e.g. `587` |
| `MAIL_USERNAME` | SMTP username | Your email |
| `MAIL_PASSWORD` | SMTP password | Your app password |
| `MAIL_ENCRYPTION` | SMTP encryption | `tls` |
| `MAIL_FROM_ADDRESS` | Sender email | `noreply@circuitbazaar.com` |
| `MAIL_FROM_NAME` | Sender name | `Circuit Bazaar` |
| `REVERB_APP_ID` | Reverb app ID | Any string |
| `REVERB_APP_KEY` | Reverb app key | Any string |
| `REVERB_APP_SECRET` | Reverb app secret | Any string |
| `REVERB_HOST` | Reverb host | `0.0.0.0` |
| `REVERB_PORT` | Reverb port | `8080` |
| `REVERB_SCHEME` | Reverb scheme | `http` |
| `REVERB_SERVER_HOST` | Reverb server bind | `0.0.0.0` |
| `REVERB_SERVER_PORT` | Reverb server port | `8080` |
| `TWILIO_SID` | Twilio account SID | From twilio.com console |
| `TWILIO_TOKEN` | Twilio auth token | From twilio.com console |
| `TWILIO_FROM` | Twilio sender number | Your Twilio number |
| `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` | Google OAuth client ID | From Google Cloud Console |
| `GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET` | Google OAuth client secret | From Google Cloud Console |
| `GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI` | Google OAuth redirect URI | `${APP_URL}/api/auth/google/callback` |
| `CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` | Production CORS origins (comma-separated) | Your Railway/Vercel URLs |
| `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID` | AWS access key (S3) | From AWS console |
| `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY` | AWS secret key | From AWS console |
| `AWS_DEFAULT_REGION` | AWS region | `us-east-1` |
| `AWS_BUCKET` | S3 bucket name | Your bucket |
| `CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME` | Cloudinary cloud name | From Cloudinary dashboard |
| `CLOUDINARY_API_KEY` | Cloudinary API key | From Cloudinary dashboard |
| `CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET` | Cloudinary API secret | From Cloudinary dashboard |

