## Secrets Policy

Real values live **only** in each service's own untracked `.env` / `.env.local` file.

- `.env`, `.env.local`, `.env.*.local` are all git-ignored.
- `.env.example` files are committed with **placeholder values only**.
- Never paste real API keys, database passwords, or mail credentials into shared docs or chat.
